# MCP On Demand

Use MCP tools only when required.

Railway MCP:
Use only for Railway deploys, variables, services, logs, domains, environments or production errors.

Supabase MCP:
Use only for schema, migrations, database, auth, storage, RLS, logs or project configuration.

GitHub MCP:
Use only for issues, PRs, Actions, commits, branches, repo settings or security alerts.

Resend MCP:
Use only for email sending, campaigns, contacts, broadcasts, templates or logs.

Higgsfield MCP:
Use only for image/video generation or marketing assets.

n8n:
Use only for automation workflows, background jobs, integrations, follow-ups and reports.

Do not keep all MCP tools active in every task.
